      "difficulty_reason": "The author uses a mode-sensitive presheaf model of a structural dependent type theory, together with a logical relation whose erased base and runtime fiber carry different information. The gluing model must retain universe predicates even in erased contexts. Its natural-number relation connects code extraction to standard set interpretation and yields tracking and noninterference. These are consequences of one main extraction correctness construction, counted once; routine model support and conservativity results are not split into additional items.",
